---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { imageDimensions } from '../data/media';
import ScreenShowcase from './ScreenShowcase.astro';
---
<section class="conference-output" aria-labelledby="conference-output-title">
  <div class="conference-output-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The result leaves the application</p><h3 id="conference-output-title">A deck you can keep working on.</h3><p>This sample was generated by the actual app from the fictional notes in the demonstration. Open the PowerPoint to edit its text, tables and charts, or read the PDF.</p></div>
  <div class="conference-output-grid"><a class="conference-deck-preview" href="/sample-files/conference-notes-demo.pdf" aria-label="Read the generated conference sample as a PDF"><img src="/media/conference-notes-deck.webp" {...imageDimensions('/media/conference-notes-deck.webp')} loading="lazy" alt="The generated presentation’s cover, labelled Demo data: conference insights." /><span>Read the sample presentation <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></span></a><div class="conference-downloads"><p class="eyebrow">Generated sample</p><dl><div><dt>25</dt><dd>slides</dd></div><div><dt>5</dt><dd>editable tables</dd></div><div><dt>2</dt><dd>native charts</dd></div></dl><a class="button button-dark" href="/sample-files/conference-notes-demo.pptx" download>Download PowerPoint <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-down" /></span></a><a class="text-link" href="/sample-files/conference-notes-demo.pdf">Read the PDF <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></a><p class="conference-file-note">PowerPoint 5.9 MB · PDF 636 KB<br />Fictional notes and generated analysis. Personal template-author metadata removed; slide content unchanged.</p></div></div>
  <details class="conference-source-detail"><summary>See how a theme leads back to the notes <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="plus" /></span></summary><p>The theme drawer exposes the supporting responses. This small fixture deliberately repeats some notes; the actual analysis flags that repetition. Source counts need interpretation before they become conclusions.</p><ScreenShowcase id="conference-theme-sources" desktop="/media/conference-notes-sources.webp" desktopAlt="A generated theme opens a drawer containing the fictional source notes used to support it." label="Notes behind the theme" caption="Actual analysis and source-note drawer, using fictional conference responses." /></details>
</section>
<style>
  .conference-output{margin-top:60px;padding-top:35px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .conference-output-heading{max-width:700px;margin-bottom:30px}
  .conference-output-heading .eyebrow{color:var(--rust);margin-bottom:13px}
  .conference-output-heading h3{font-size:2.25rem;margin-bottom:17px}
  .conference-output-heading p:last-child{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .conference-output-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:45px;align-items:center}
  .conference-deck-preview{display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;background:#fff}
  .conference-deck-preview img{width:100%;height:auto}
  .conference-deck-preview>span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:17px 22px;background:#e7ebde;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600}
  .conference-downloads dl{display:flex;gap:32px;margin:15px 0 25px}
  .conference-downloads dt{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2.5rem;line-height:1.2;color:var(--forest)}
  .conference-downloads dd{font-size:.68rem;margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}
  .conference-downloads .button{font-size:.86rem}
  .conference-downloads .text-link{display:flex;width:fit-content;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:7px}
  .conference-file-note{font-size:.66rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-top:18px;max-width:350px}
  .conference-source-detail{margin-top:35px;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
  .conference-source-detail summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:19px 0;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:550}
  .conference-source-detail>p{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:750px;margin:4px 0 28px}
  .conference-source-detail[open]{padding-bottom:30px}
  @media(max-width:820px){.conference-output-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.conference-downloads dl{gap:35px}.conference-output-heading h3{font-size:2rem}}
</style>
